8066 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 8067 0 R/Alt(Two sketches of the density rho against r/r_sh. Left: at early times the supernova ejecta, a high plateau, end at r/r_sh = 1 and move outwards into the interstellar medium, a low plateau. Right: at later times a reverse shock, moving inwards with respect to the gas, separates the ejecta from a higher plateau of shocked gas, which ends at the forward shock at r/r_sh = 1; beyond it is the cold interstellar medium.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[109]/Pg 22003 0 R>>
