8602 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 8603 0 R/Alt(A closed curve C(t), drawn as a solid black line with an arrow showing its counterclockwise orientation, encloses the surface A(t). A short element dl of the curve is drawn as an arrow along it. In a time dt the fluid carries the curve to a new position, C(t + dt), drawn as a dashed line, displaced to the upper right and slightly stretched. Each point of dl moves by v dt, drawn as an arrow from the start of dl. The element sweeps a small shaded parallelogram with sides dl and v dt, whose area is dA = v dt cross dl.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[149]/Pg 22014 0 R>>
endobj
