<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 10722 0 R/Alt(Surface density against x equal to R over R_0, from 0 to 2.5, at four times tau equal to 0.008, 0.032, 0.128 and 0.512, each in a different colour and line style. At the earliest time the curve is a narrow peak at x equal to 1, of height about 3. At later times the peak becomes lower and wider and moves slightly towards smaller x; at tau equal to 0.512 the curve is almost flat, at about 0.4, and extends from x equal to 0 to beyond x equal to 2.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 22049 0 R>>
