10957 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 10958 0 R/Alt(Log-log plot of the flux F_nu, in arbitrary units, against h nu over k_B T_*, from about 3 times 10 to the minus 6 to 20. Vertical dotted lines mark k_B T_out at 10 to the minus 3 and k_B T_* at 1. Below k_B T_out the spectrum follows a dashed line proportional to nu squared. Between the two dotted lines it rises slowly, following a dash-dotted line proportional to nu to the one third. Above k_B T_* it drops steeply, in an exponential Wien cutoff.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[144]/Pg 22053 0 R>>
endobj
